<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1" version="1.1" creator="marathon-training/canyonlands-2026">
 <metadata>
  <name>Oct 4 Dress Rehearsal - two loops, opposite rotations, from Doudy Draw TH</name>
  <desc>Lap 1 (easy, HR 125-145): Doudy Draw TH, 0.6 mi to the junction, the AllTrails Marshall Mesa / Dowdy Draw loop run counter-clockwise, back to the car. 60 s stop. Lap 2 (race effort, HR 150-156): the MTB Project Marshall Mesa / Doudy Draw loop run counter-clockwise - climb off the stop, descend to finish, matching the Canyonlands finish. Sources: mtbproject.com/trail/520343 ; alltrails.com/trail/us/colorado/marshall-mesa-and-dowdy-draw</desc>
 </metadata>
 <wpt lat="39.938078" lon="-105.256563"><ele>1725.8</ele><name>Doudy Draw TH - start / 60s aid stop / finish</name></wpt>
 <wpt lat="39.930528" lon="-105.258180"><ele>1757.6</ele><name>Junction - lap 1 joins the big loop here and returns here</name></wpt>
